I believe we went over this subject extensively when the Alice translator
contacted us about his intention to publish the Lojban version in his
translation collection. I'm sure someone with the desire could find that
thread. I think it's about a year old now.

The subject line for the discussion that generated the typography debate is
"[lojban] la .alis." On my gmail there are at least three threads with this
title, so there is probably some slogging to do.

I would not be surprised if the results of the debate were posted on the
tiki somewhere, thus negating the need to slog. Someone else may have that
information.

